Subject: RE: Renault Tender Kick Off Meeting Minutes

TO : ALL CONCERNED

FM : PUSBE


Good day.

We would inform you of PUSBS has succeeded in attracting Renault's 2014 shipment from KRPUS to MYPKG with VLCBB.

In order to keep making good biz relationship with Renault and Renault Samsung, please refer to below details about this business.


= Details =

1. Shipper: Renault Samsung Motors

2. Item: Auto parts with dangerous cargo(Batteries, Airbag Inflators and Seatbelt pretensioner)

3. POL/POD: KRPUS/MYPKG

4. Vol: 1009 Teu / Year

On top of that, Renault has held 2014 bidding both in France and Japan for their 310,000 Teus shipment,

which each POL sales office should be updated with sufficient information in timely manner so that HJS can attract this business as much as we can.


In this sense, we request you to check out status of Renault's 2014 bidding and share it with each sales office in timely manner as

Renault Samsung in Korea requested PUSBS to make a presentation for KRPUS-MYPKG business last June.

This means a sales represantative has to prepare and make a presentation when each Renault office requests it if HJS is nominated one of finalist.


Furthermore, it is recommendable for each sales office to check out suitable lanes for Renault's shipment

due to the fact that their cargos contain Airbag Inflators and Seatbelt pretensioner(UNNO 3268, CLASS 9)

which is under severe restriction in SGSIN for its transshipment.


It is expected that this business can contribute to HJS' 2014 profit, and we hope everyone's keen attention on 2014 bidding.





