<div class="WordSection1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">TO : PUSBE<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">CC : UCG, TYOBB<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">FM : ASM<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">Appreciate providing your local information and business development with Renault Samsung<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">We well acknowledge of the tender for 2014 and currently ASM, TYOBB, LEHBB are working on this bidding accordingly.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">You can refer to the attached email exchange for your better understanding of current status.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">rgds.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
