<br>
<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 22, 2013 3:59 PM<br>
<b>To:</b> Jean-Pascal BIDOIRE; KYOHEI SUNAGA; Woojung Kim; YOSHITSUGU KAGAWA; Jessie(Ji-Soo) YOON; David Malbos; Mark(Yoon-Jai) LEE; Kenny CHIN; Brian MARTORANO; Patricia HALSALL; Sunha KANG; Richard NUZZI; Sang-Ryun JEON; Sheldon SHIKHEL; Peter (Ho Seob)
