<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">Good day.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">We would inform you of
<strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">PUSBS has succeeded in attracting Renault's 2014 shipment from KRPUS to MYPKG with VLCBB.</span></strong></span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">In order to keep making good biz relationship with Renault and Renault Samsung, please refer to below details about this business.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">= Details =</span></strong><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">1. Shipper: Renault Samsung Motors</span></strong><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">2. Item: Auto parts with dangerous cargo(Batteries, Airbag Inflators and Seatbelt pretensioner)</span></strong><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
