<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">which each POL sales office should&nbsp;be updated&nbsp;with sufficient information in timely manner so that HJS can attract this business as much as we can.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
