<strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">check out status of Renault's 2014 bidding and share it with each sales office&nbsp;in timely manner</span></strong>&nbsp;as
</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">Renault Samsung in Korea requested PUSBS to make a presentation&nbsp;for KRPUS-MYPKG business last June.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">This means a sales represantative has to prepare and make a presentation when each Renault office requests it if HJS is nominated one of finalist.</span></strong><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">Furthermore, it is recommendable for each sales office to
<strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">check out suitable lanes for Renault's shipment</span></strong><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">due to the fact that
<strong><span style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">their cargos contain Airbag Inflators and Seatbelt pretensioner(UNNO 3268, CLASS 9)</span></strong><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;;color:#1F497D">which is under
