</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Have spoken to Key person in Nissan Motor and found as follows.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">1) Target date for RFQ distribition is NOV19 as an outcome from Renault's meeting</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">2) Nissan has larger volume on ASIA-EUR trade and It is almost sure for Nissan&nbsp;to mainly control the trade on their tender,</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">however they still work on fixing role of Renault and Nissan by lane.&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Further details won't be available until RFQ is given.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">3) Indivisual negotiation has been ongoing. Nissan&nbsp;suggested target rate for 3 year contract to</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">7 carriers and now waiting for an outcome from each carrier.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">4) Target rate can not be disclosed to others than designated carrier.</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">5) Specific lanes included in&nbsp;open tender will vary by results of indivisual negotiation.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">Though we are not listed in an indivisual negotiation carrier, submitted our wish list of lanes where we want to be involved in next 3 years.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">We will continue to seek through communication with Nissan for further details and any hints to&nbsp;form our strategy.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
