</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">1 round offer: Dec. 12th
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">1 round F2F: W4 2014
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">2 round offer: W5 2014
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">2 round F2F: W6 </span>
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l1 level2 lfo2">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Nomination: Early March 2014</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</ul>
<ul type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l10 level1 lfo3">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Tender contents:</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</div>
<ul type="disc">
<ul type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l8 level2 lfo4">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">3 year rate validity for routes covering &quot;mature&quot;, or &quot;steady&quot; markets (such as AESW, TPSE)
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l8 level2 lfo4">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">1 year validity for &quot;volatile&quot; or &quot;emerging&quot; markets (such as&nbsp;Latam)
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l8 level2 lfo4">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">a SLA (Service Level Agreement)</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</ul>
<ul type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l6 level1 lfo5">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Potential volumes: More than 310,000&nbsp;TEUs per year (1/3 for Renault, rest for Nissan)
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
<p style="margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-18.0pt"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Symbol">&middot;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size:7.0pt;font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span><strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue">Renault/Nissan negotiation parties are&nbsp;split between Paris and Tokyo:</span></strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<ul type="disc">
<ul type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo6">
<strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue">Europe to/from Latam: Paris</span></strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;">
<o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l9 level2 lfo6">
<strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue">Other trades: Tokyo</span></strong><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</ul>
<ul type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo7">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Bidding platforms: </span>
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
<ul type="disc">
<ul type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo8">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Paris negotiated portion: OCCON
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l2 level2 lfo8">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Tokyo negotiated portion: Excel sheets</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</ul>
<ul type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo9">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Selection criteria:
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
<ul type="disc">
<ul type="circle">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo10">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">O/F level </span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo10">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Transit time (no T/S, 1 additional day transit time is valued at a cost of USD 20/25)
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo10">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">There will be a floating mechanism, but not yet fixed, probably a BAF reviewed every 6 months
</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li><li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level2 lfo10">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">7 to 10 carrier globally will be selected</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
</ul>
<ul type="disc">
<li class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo11">
<span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">There are also 3 or 4 port/pairs that dont fall under the 1 or 3 year validity tenders.&nbsp;They will be follow a more simple RFQ process</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></li></ul>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">A presentation of the bid will be distributed in the coming days, i will forward it to relevant parties as soon as received.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Similar presentation will be held in Japan.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><u><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">UCM recommendations</span></u><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">:</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">As per Renault/Nissan's set up of having 2 negotiation parties, it is difficult to have 1 internal Customer Management team</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">to handle this customer. However as per their split of trades, HJS has the most potential and interest in the Tokyo negotiated part. For the Paris negotiated part, HJS allocation and service is
 limited.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Therefore, would suggest that ASM takes over the lead on this customer in collaboration with TYOBB.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">LEHBB will remain as contact window for the Paris part.</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Kind Regards,</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">UCM</span><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
<div>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
